{{also|Martingale}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|martingal}}

===Etymology===
{{bor|en|frm|martingale}}, from {{der|en|oc|martegalo}}, feminine form of {{m|oc|martegal}}, an inhabitant of {{w|Martigues}}, which is from {{der|en|la|maritima}}. Alternatively from {{der|en|es|almártaga}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A piece of [[harness]] used on a [[horse]] to keep it from raising its head above a desired point.
# {{lb|en|nautical}} A [[spar]], or piece of [[rigging]] that [[strengthen]]s the [[bowsprit]].
# {{lb|en|mathematics}} A [[stochastic process]] for which the {{w|conditional expectation}} of future values given the sequence of all prior values is equal to the current value.
#: {{ux|en|If a gambler plays a fair game repeatedly, his payoff over time is a '''martingale'''.}}
# A [[gambling]] [[strategy]] in which one [[double]]s the [[stake]] after each [[loss]].
# {{lb|en|fencing}} A [[strap]] attached to the sword handle, preventing a sword being dropped if [[disarmed]].

